OL,3,GNEWSAOwner 'overwhelmed' after dog lost
OL,4,Ain storm found
OL,5,
OL,6,FA dog which escaped from the garden of
OL,7,Fher new home during Storm Boelo has
OL,8,Fbeen found after four days on the run.
OL,10,FNatasha Lapsley said she had only owned
OL,11,FSuzie the cocker spaniel for about 90
OL,12,Fminutes when strong winds blew open her
OL,13,Fgarden gate.
OL,15,FAfter tracking her new pet around
OL,16,Fhousing estates in Ramsey for more than
OL,17,Fan hour, Natasha said she lost sight of
OL,18,FSuzie and contacted Noodle's Canine
OL,19,FRescue (NCR).
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
