OL,3,GNEWSAOwner 'overwhelmed' after dog lost
OL,4,Ain storm found
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I just felt sick with anxiety worrying
OL,7,Fabout her," she explained. "The weather
OL,8,Fwas so bad and she was out in a place
OL,9,Fshe didn't even know."
